# A standalone development lock: include runtime requirements and pin them to
# the already-generated runtime lock before adding development-only tooling.
-r requirements.in
-c requirements.txt

# The compiler is exact so generated lockfile headers stay reproducible. Its
# setuptools dependency is pinned and hashed in requirements-dev.txt.
